		}
		{
			description: [
				"Hidden beneath the surface of this untamed world lies the &2Primordial Caves&r, a vast prehistoric ecosystem untouched by time."
				""
				"Here, evolution reached its peak during the age of reptiles. Towering &bPewen Trees&r stretch toward the cavern ceiling while ancient ferns, cycads, and glowing flora blanket the landscape below. Colossal creatures such as the mighty &6Tremorsaurus&r, cunning &cRelicheirus&r, and countless other prehistoric beasts roam freely, ruling a world where humanity is no longer the apex predator."
				""
				"Every step into these ancient caverns is a journey millions of years into the past."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Though the dinosaurs now reign supreme, they were not the first inhabitants of this forgotten world."
				""
				"Scattered throughout the Primordial Caves are mysterious &6Cave Paintings&r, ancient artwork left behind by a long-lost civilization. These remarkable murals depict great hunts, towering beasts, and everyday life among the prehistoric wilderness, preserving the stories of a people long vanished from history."
				""
				"Take time to admire these paintings as you explore—they offer a fascinating glimpse into the civilization that once called these caverns home."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beyond their breathtaking beauty, the Primordial Caves are rich with resources essential for your continued progression."
				""
				"Explore towering volcanoes, search abandoned Caveman settlements, hunt prehistoric creatures, and gather the rare materials hidden throughout this ancient world. Many of these resources are required to craft advanced technologies and, ultimately, complete the &cTier 6 Rocket&r."
				""
				"The age of dinosaurs has endured for millions of years."
				""
				"Now, it's your turn to leave your mark upon it."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
