		{
			dependencies: ["1FE777D1CAD0CE01"]
			description: [
				"The &2Primordial Caves&r are ruled by colossal creatures that have survived unchanged since the dawn of time."
				""
				"From towering herbivores to relentless predators, these ancient beasts dominate every corner of the prehistoric world. Their immense size and incredible resilience are owed to their dense skeletal structure—a material unlike any bone found elsewhere throughout your journey."
				""
				"Hunting these creatures is dangerous, but the rewards are well worth the risk."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Many of the dinosaurs inhabiting the Primordial Caves will occasionally drop &fHeavy Bones&r when defeated."
				""
				"These remarkably durable remains are prized by engineers and craftsmen alike, serving as a key ingredient in several advanced crafting recipes. While some dinosaurs are relatively peaceful, others will fiercely defend their territory, making every hunt a test of both skill and preparation."
				""
				"Choose your battles wisely."
				""
				"Not every prehistoric giant should be challenged unprepared."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you continue exploring the Primordial Caves, gather a healthy supply of &fHeavy Bones&r for future projects."
				""
				"Sometimes, the strongest materials aren't forged in a factory—"
				""
				"They're earned through survival in a world where humanity is no longer the apex predator."
			]
