		{
			dependencies: ["1FE777D1CAD0CE01"]
			description: [
				"The lush forests of the &2Primordial Caves&r are home to ancient plant life that has flourished since long before humanity first walked the Overworld."
				""
				"Among these prehistoric forests you'll discover several unique ingredients used to prepare one of the planet's most remarkable meals: the &2Serene Salad&r."
				""
				"Gather &2Tree Stars&r from the towering &aAncient Jungle Trees&r, harvest &ePine Nuts&r from the majestic &bPewen Trees&r, and search &6Caveman Houses&r for &3Fiddleheads&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Combining these ancient ingredients creates the &2Serene Salad&r, a restorative meal unlike any other."
				""
				"Beyond its nutritional value, this peaceful dish possesses a remarkable effect upon one of the Primordial Caves' most fearsome inhabitants—the mighty &6Tremorsaurus&r."
				""
				"Though feared by most explorers, these colossal beasts can be won over by those patient enough to earn their trust."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To tame a &6Tremorsaurus&r, first weaken it by striking it with a &aPrimal Club&r. Once the creature has been stunned, quickly feed it a &2Serene Salad&r before it recovers."
				""
				"This process must be repeated &73–8 times&r before the Tremorsaurus finally accepts you as its rider."
				""
				"After taming two Tremorsauruses, feed them either &cRaw&r or &eCooked Dinosaur Chops&r. Given enough space, they will burrow into the earth and produce a rare &dTremorzilla Egg&r."
				""
				"Mine the egg with a &bSilk Touch&r tool to safely collect it for future use."
				""
				"Not every prehistoric giant must be defeated."
				""
				"Some become your greatest allies."
			]
