		{
			dependencies: ["1FE777D1CAD0CE01"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the fiery heart of the &2Primordial Caves&r slumbers the &6Luxtructosaurus&r, an ancient titan born from molten stone and the untamed power of the prehistoric world."
				""
				"Towering above every other creature on the planet, this colossal beast is said to have shaped the very landscape with each thunderous step. Its molten scales radiate intense heat, while its earth-shaking roar echoes throughout the caverns, warning all who dare challenge the ruler of the ancient world."
				""
				"Will you awaken the king of the Primordial Caves, or leave its legend undisturbed?"
				""
				"{image:alexscaves:textures/misc/advancement/icon/defeat_luxtructosaurus.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To summon the &6Luxtructosaurus&r, you must first obtain an &4Ominous Catalyst&r."
				""
				"Once prepared, journey to an active &cVolcano&r and cast the catalyst into its molten core. Moments later, the volcano will erupt violently as the Luxtructosaurus emerges from the magma, ready to defend its ancient domain."
				""
				"Be certain you are fully prepared before beginning the ritual."
				""
				"Once awakened, there is no turning back."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &6Luxtructosaurus&r is among the most powerful creatures you'll encounter throughout your adventure."
				""
				"Its devastating charges, crushing bites, and volcanic attacks can overwhelm even the best-equipped explorers. Bring powerful armor, healing supplies, and plenty of room to maneuver, as the battlefield quickly becomes a chaotic inferno."
				""
				"Victory, however, is well worth the risk."
				""
				"Defeating the Luxtructosaurus rewards you with rare &6Tectonic Shards&r, crystallized fragments of volcanic energy required to craft the legendary &dTremorzilla Egg&r."
				""
				"Keep this priceless material safe—it will become invaluable once you continue your journey to the &aToxic Caves&r, where the true power of Tremorzilla can finally be unleashed."
			]
