		{
			dependencies: ["172EE8617C59F90A"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the &8Forlorn Hollows&r, the &8Underzealots&r perform a sinister ritual in service of an ancient power."
				""
				"Rather than simply hunting their prey, these fanatical cultists seek out peaceful &5Gloomoths&r, offering them as sacrifices to summon a mysterious guardian known only as the &7Watcher&r. Few adventurers have ever witnessed the ceremony firsthand, and even fewer have survived the creature that emerges."
				""
				"Will you uncover the truth behind the ritual, or become another victim claimed by the darkness?"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To witness the ritual, you must first locate both an &8Underzealot&r and a nearby &5Gloomoth&r."
				""
				"Gloomoths are naturally attracted to &elight sources&r, often circling torches, lanterns, and other glowing blocks. Placing additional light sources near an Underzealot can encourage nearby Gloomoths to approach, increasing the chances of the ritual taking place."
				""
				"Remain nearby and be patient. Once the Underzealot captures a Gloomoth, the sacrifice will begin, transforming the unfortunate creature into a &7Watcher&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &7Watcher&r is one of the most dangerous creatures found within the Forlorn Hollows."
				""
				"Its powerful attacks and dark magic make it a formidable opponent, rewarding only those capable of overcoming the ritual's final guardian. Defeating the Watcher is the only way to obtain the rare &5Occult Gem&r, a mysterious relic infused with the corrupt energy of the Hollows and required for several advanced crafting recipes later in your adventure."
				""
				"The darkness always demands a sacrifice."
				""
				"Make sure it isn't you."
			]
			id: "5271C7F38BCADF3F"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "64392B80DACB74EE"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "alexscaves:totem_of_possession"
						tag: {
							Damage: 0
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "78672B181CC2098A"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 500
				}
			]
			shape: "pentagon"
			tasks: [{
