				icon: "alexscaves:occult_gem"
				id: "37891D8EF5B00CC2"
				type: "kill"
				value: 1L
			}]
			title: "Slay the Watcher"
			x: 20.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["172EE8617C59F90A"]
			description: [
				"The &8Forlorn Hollows&r are home to countless forgotten rituals, but none are more disturbing than those performed by the fanatical &5Underzealots&r."
				""
				"These devoted followers wander the darkness in search of &cVespers&r, strange bat-like creatures that become unwilling participants in an ancient sacrificial ceremony. Once the ritual begins, there is little hope for the unfortunate creature as dark energy slowly transforms it into the monstrous &4Forsaken&r."
				""
				"Witnessing this forbidden ritual is a chilling reminder of the Hollows' corrupted past."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"If you wish to confront the &4Forsaken&r, you'll first need to locate an &5Underzealot&r and a nearby &cVesper&r."
				""
				"The transformation does not happen immediately, so remain nearby and be patient. Given enough time, the Underzealot will begin its ritual, surrounding the Vesper with dark magic until the creature is consumed by the corruption and reborn as the Forsaken."
				""
				"Once the ritual has begun, prepare yourself for battle."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &4Forsaken&r is a far more formidable foe than the creatures from which it is born."
				""
				"Its powerful attacks and overwhelming strength make it one of the deadliest inhabitants of the &8Forlorn Hollows&r, rewarding only those capable of surviving the encounter. Defeating the Forsaken grants valuable materials used throughout advanced crafting and later stages of progression, bringing you one step closer to completing the &cTier 6 Rocket&r."
				""
				"In the Hollows, even the innocent are not spared from corruption."
				""
				"Bring an end to the ritual—and the creature it creates."
			]
