		{
			dependencies: ["28BF44B23933663F"]
			description: [
				"Radiating a golden warmth, these vents are woven into the fossil-rich stone of a biome untouched by time. Surrounded by prehistoric giants and luminous flora, the &6Amberlite Vent&r pulses with the energy of a lost age, waiting to be awakened."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/amberlite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken this fossilized furnace, feed a blaze burner blaze cake directly atop the vent’s surface. The resulting transformation will rupture the ancient crust, activating the vent and making it receptive to molten input."
				""
				"Once active, the vent will accept &dhoney&r. Feed it well, and you'll unlock fully automated &6Amber&r generation through &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				" &7Dig deep. Ignite the ancient spark. Harvest the treasures of a world long forgotten.&r"
			]
