		{
			dependencies: ["1B15E155B3471D38"]
			description: [
				"Encrusted in the foul rock of a cursed biome, the &7Guanite Vent&r emanates a putrid stillness. Amid twisted stone and rotting echoes, these vents represent decay reborn into utility-ready to fuel automation for those who dare to delve too deep."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/guanite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken its vile potential, &lfeed a blaze burner blaze cake&r upon the vent’s dormant surface. The transformation will stir the festering stone into an active state, transforming it into a viable node for molten fluid input."
				""
				"Once active, supplying &dliquid fertilizer&r will allow &fGuano&r to be fully automated via &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				" &7From waste comes worth. Will you claim the power buried beneath decay?&r"
			]
