		{
			description: [
				"Hidden deep within a realm of charged stone and shifting magnetism, the &cNeodymrium Vent&r hums with potential. Its scarlet glow flickers with kinetic tension, offering a gateway to automating one of the most advanced resources in the known dimensions."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/neodymrium_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To harness this volatile power, place &la blaze burner&r directly atop the dormant vent and feed it blaze cake. The resulting transformation awakens the vent, charging it with the ability to accept molten input for automated processing."
				""
				"Once activated, the proper &dsource fluid&r (revealed in the next quest) will allow you to extract &4Scarlet Neodymrium&r using &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				" &7Tame the pulse of magnetism and unleash the might of automation.&r"
			]
			icon: "create_resource_vents:dormant_neodymrium_vent"
			id: "08A5AEA1CB0268D8"
			rewards: [{
