		{
			description: [
				"Tucked among twisting stone and humming circuitry, the &bAzurnium Vent&r radiates with a cool, charged brilliance. Its azure glow pulses gently with mechanical elegance-awaiting activation by a bold adventurer prepared to shape raw energy into refined potential."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/azurnium_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken the power within, &lplace a blaze burner on the vent&r and feed it blaze cake. This surge of force will ignite its dormant state, transforming it into an operational conduit for molten infusion."
				""
				"Once activated, you’ll need to deliver the correct &dsource fluid&r-explained in the next quest-to begin generating &3Azure Neodymrium&r with &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				" &7Stabilize the current. Channel the flow. And craft with the clarity of precision engineering.&r"
			]
			icon: "create_resource_vents:dormant_azurnium_vent"
			id: "1F8D8293900A159B"
