		{
			description: [
				"Tucked amid the noxious terrain and acidic pools, the &eSulphite Vent&r gives off a faint, sulfurous hiss. These dormant formations conceal volatile potential, waiting for a spark to awaken their burning core."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/sulphite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To ignite the process, place &la blaze burner&r directly on top of a dormant Sulphite Vent and feed it blaze cake. The transformation force will awaken the vent, converting it into an active conduit for molten extraction."
				""
				"Once activated, supplying the correct &dsource fluid&r-explained in the following quest-will enable &lMechanical Extruders&r to refine sulfur endlessly from the depths of corruption."
				""
				" &7Sulfur waits in silence-but not for long. Will you brave the fumes and harness its sting?&r"
			]
