		{
			description: [
				"&dFound deep in the Candy Cavity caves-your gateway to Ethium automation!"
				""
				"Hidden beneath the whimsical yet dangerous layers of the &dCandy Cavity&r lies the &5Lost Debris Vent&r-a bizarre and rare geyser steeped in sugary sediment, essential for automating &dEthium&r. Though playful in appearance, this vent holds serious power for those who dare to extract it."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/lost_debris_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken this confection-powered vent, place &la blaze burner&r directly on top and feed it a blaze cake. The sweet crust will shatter open, revealing the vent’s molten potential."
				""
				"Once active, provide the proper &dsource fluid&r (revealed in the next quest) to fuel &lMechanical Extruders&r and begin your Lost Debris conversion process."
				""
				" &5The cavity cracks-are you ready to extract the essence of Ethium from this delicious core?&r"
			]
